publishedVersionEvidence: SEDM has NO published version. These are working documents (TQ ruling 2026-10-23, PLAN-nextStandards-102326 section 12: "yes, attic"). The JSON's _meta.version 1.0 is the version of its extraction from "SEDM Conceptual Model.md" (extractedDate 2026-04-01), not of SEDM; the CSV states no version. When a published SEDM artefact appears it replaces these as a new snapshot.
publisher: the SEDM working group (PCG / AEM / Education Analytics, through Ed3 and Data Standards United; CENSUS-candidateStandards-102326 row 6). No public URL is recorded for these files.
